%%report baggage-batch-largest-by-expected-bags title: The ten largest baggage batches by expected bags entity: BaggageBatch chart: bar x: record y: expected_bags help: An aggregate hold-baggage batch on a movement. The records with the highest expected bags; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT reference::text AS record, expected_bags FROM bus_baggage_batch WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND expected_bags IS NOT NULL ORDER BY expected_bags DESC LIMIT 10
%%report baggage-batch-counted-bags-by-status title: Total counted bags by status entity: BaggageBatch chart: bar x: status y: total_counted_bags help: An aggregate hold-baggage batch on a movement. Baggage Batches added up on counted bags, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(counted_bags)::numeric, 2) AS total_counted_bags FROM bus_baggage_batch WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
